---
// ACT 8 · PRICE + CTA
---
<section id="price" style="position:relative; padding:150px 28px; border-top:1px solid #1c1c1e; text-align:center;">
  <div style="max-width:900px; margin:0 auto;">
    <h2 data-reveal style="margin:0; font-family:'Geist Mono'; font-weight:700; font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,76px); line-height:1.02; letter-spacing:-0.03em;">% of <span style="color:#6cf0a8;">proven</span> savings.</h2>
    <p data-reveal style="margin:22px auto 0; font-size:15px; color:#a9a9a2; max-width:520px; line-height:1.7;">Pay only on the savings we measure, or a flat platform fee. No markup on tokens, ever. Self-host &amp; OSS are free.</p>
    <div data-reveal style="margin:42px auto 0; max-width:560px; border:1px solid #1c1c1e; background:#08110d; text-align:left;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:9px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #1c1c1e; font-size:11px; color:#55554f;"><span>~/.zshrc</span><button id="copybtn" data-cursor style="font-size:11px; color:#6cf0a8; background:transparent; border:1px solid #2a3a30; padding:3px 9px; cursor:pointer;">[ copy ]</button></div>
      <pre id="snippet" style="margin:0; padding:16px 14px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.8; color:#e6e6e1; white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-all;">$ export ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://gw.tokenomics.dev
$ export ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=tok_&lt;your-token&gt;</pre>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="margin-top:30px; display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="/signup" data-cursor style="font-size:15px; color:#0a0a0b; background:#6cf0a8; text-decoration:none; padding:14px 24px;">[ get your token ]</a>
      <a href="/docs" data-cursor style="font-size:15px; color:#e6e6e1; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #3a3a3c; padding:14px 24px;">read the docs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
